// Description: Detects execution of WMIC (Windows Management Instrumentation Command-line tool), often abused for reconnaissance, lateral movement, and remote execution
// Data Source: DeviceProcessEvents
// Severity: Medium to High (LOLBIN Abuse / Lateral Movement)
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1047, T1059, T1021
// False Positives: IT administration, system monitoring tools, enterprise automation scripts

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine has "wmic" or FileName == "wmic.exe"
| project Timestamp, DeviceName, ProcessCommandLine, InitiatingProcessAccountName
